共兩個人一起來吃，都點鍋燒意麵，我朋友的上來的沒問題，我的一上來意麵就已經泡到很爛了不知道為什麼，我們加的麵上來也是長得不太一樣，看起來很明顯煮的時間不同，很奇妙。\n後來詢問店員，回覆也是蠻傻眼，一開始問為什麼上來的兩個麵體軟硬度完全不一樣，其中一個很軟爛\n店員：喔因為煮的時間不一樣啊\n再度詢問那我這一碗意麵一端上來就已經軟爛成這樣了是怎麼了？\n店員：因為煮比較久，所以你要換是嗎？？？\n全程的態度跟表情感受都很不好，提問也被當作找麻煩的感覺，之後不會再光顧，服務業辛苦，不過不應該這樣處理，很大的改進空間\n吃起來普通，加上服務態度，可能1.5顆星吧，多送你們0.5顆",null,[0,131]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7610333975394863176/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVW1Kc1ZqUmlNVUUwWTJzNVpsTlhlRXhTTVZaSFpFaEdXV0Z1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7610333975394863176/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVW1Kc1ZqUmlNVUUwWTJzNVpsTlhlRXhTTVZaSFpFaEdXV0Z1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7610333975394863176/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVW1Kc1ZqUmlNVUUwWTJzNVpsTlhlRXhTTVZaSFpFaEdXV0Z1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7610333975394863176/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVW1Kc1ZqUmlNVUUwWTJzNVpsTlhlRXhTTVZaSFpFaEdXV0Z1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7610333975394863176/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVW1Kc1ZqUmlNVUUwWTJzNVpsTlhlRXhTTVZaSFpFaEdXV0Z1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7610333975394863176/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVW1Kc1ZqUmlNVUUwWTJzNVpsTlhlRXhTTVZaSFpFaEdXV0Z1WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,2355,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GUmJsVjRiMUE0Y2s5ZlNXeExSMVZHZEhGWWFuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x90d8ff251fa75c61!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmFRblV4b1A4ck9fSWxLR1VGdHFYanc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GUmJsVjRiMUE0Y2s5ZlNXeExSMVZHZEhGWWFuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GUmJsVjRiMUE0Y2s5ZlNXeExSMVZHZEhGWWFuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT